  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Expanded Spheres: Baron's Lost Apocrypha</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Mana Sphere (Gift of Knowledge)</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use Gift of Knowledge, you may choose to affect the target with one additional non-harmless magic sphere effect you can create with equivalent or greater range to your (manipulate) as part of the same action, spending spell points as normal. If the target succeeds at their saving throw against the effect or is otherwise unaffected, they do not gain the benefits of Gift of Knowledge.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may use this feat even if you possess the Benefactor drawback. If you have the benefactor drawback, you may take this feat as a drawback feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mana#toc115\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
